  "question": {
    "text": "In series LCR circuit, the capacitance is changed from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi></math>. To keep the resonance frequency unchanged, the new inductance should be :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "q1y5D",
      "text": "reduced by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>L</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s6atj",
      "text": "increased by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "jfkwS",
      "text": "reduced by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>L</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r5KTY",
      "text": "increased to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As resonance frequency remains unchanged, therefore <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ω</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ω</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>L</mi><mo>'</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>'</mo></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo> </mo><mi>L</mi><mo>'</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>'</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∵</mo></math> Inductance must be decreased by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
